                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e78a0523-862d-35c0-848f-1597b512f73f",
                        "entry_id": "5a4f5061-47b8-30a1-9e56-78d0a83a6148",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who shanks (in any of various senses).",
                            "One who shanks a golf ball."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b566d3a-c257-46f4-a80d-c938991ef77e",
                                "sense_id": "e78a0523-862d-35c0-848f-1597b512f73f",
                                "text": "Littler said he didn't shank it; rather he called it a soft pop-up, but us old hard-core shankers weren't so generous ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a07529e-f93f-415e-b5bd-a0bfd6289caf",
                                "sense_id": "e78a0523-862d-35c0-848f-1597b512f73f",
                                "text": "He said, \"Our whole club is full of shankers.\" […] This club was infested with shankers, as if they all had a disease. […] The danger in hitting down on the ball with such intensity is that you are likely to shank it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dabe19f4-fd26-40e2-b91c-a92048ec8d3e",
                                "sense_id": "e78a0523-862d-35c0-848f-1597b512f73f",
                                "text": "And for the next twenty minutes, he shanked every shot. I did everything I could. […] And he still shanked every shot. […] “Sooooo, Butchie's got a shanker and can't get him squared up, huh?” he shouted so loud that ...\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "780c4b55-1b66-3cf8-8040-c39cc1815eea",
                        "entry_id": "5a4f5061-47b8-30a1-9e56-78d0a83a6148",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who shanks (in any of various senses).",
                            "One who glues the shank into a shoe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90f925ce-75e3-48f0-b759-68fe87c754ae",
                                "sense_id": "780c4b55-1b66-3cf8-8040-c39cc1815eea",
                                "text": "A shank-cutter cuts with a die that part of the shank which is composed of leather or leather board. […] A shanker tacks the shank in place, cuts away the superfluous upper leather gathered under the toe, beats the edge of the upper out […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dede368-c061-4c35-bed0-d7196f984a9a",
                                "sense_id": "780c4b55-1b66-3cf8-8040-c39cc1815eea",
                                "text": "I take those metal shanks, slide the backs of them in glue and make them lie down on the shoe-bottoms, […] Last week they ran a contest to see which shankers shanked fastest. I'm not embarrassed to say I beat them all."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
